{"about_the_game":"For the first time ever, you are able to immerse yourself in a world of milling.<br><br>Use a conventional milling machine to drill, mill, grind and cut.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/milling.gif?t=1737116071\" /><br><br>Import your own blueprints, to prototype unique products in Free milling mode.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/import_blueprint.gif?t=1737116071\" /><br><br>Measure with precision and complete challenging tasks in Career mode.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/measure.gif?t=1737116071\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/workpiece_selection.gif?t=1737116071\" /><br><br>Customize workpieces to fit your needs, by choosing materials and size.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/create_workpiece.gif?t=1737116071\" /><br><br>Get everything done with realistic physics and movement. And don't forget your cutting tools can break!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/break_tool.gif?t=1737116071\" />","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1787960?t=1737116071","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1737116071","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737116071","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737116071","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam W